# 备案期备用口：18780（勿用 8000，轻量上 8000 多为 Supabase，会 401）
# 1) 防火墙模板增加 TCP 18780 / 0.0.0.0/0
# 2) 在 ECS：
#   sudo tee /etc/nginx/snippets/erp-api-18780.conf < ~/app/scripts/ecs-nginx-erp-api-18780.snippet
#   printf '%s\n' 'include snippets/erp-api-18780.conf;' | sudo tee /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/erp-api-18780.conf
#   sudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx
#   curl -sS -H "Host: mofangdianai.com" http://127.0.0.1:18780/erp-api/mp-cronet-ping

server {
    listen 18780;
    server_name mofangdianai.com 139.196.42.5;

    location = /erp-api/mp-cronet-ping {
        default_type application/json;
        add_header Access-Control-Allow-Origin * always;
        return 200 '{"ok":true,"via":"nginx-cronet-ping-18780"}';
    }

    location /erp-api/ {
        client_max_body_size 4m;
        gzip off;
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto http;
    }
}
